    {
      "name": "2. Clientes (CRUD - ADMIN)",
      "description": "Ciclo completo do recurso `/clientes`. **Criar cliente** gera um e-mail unico por execucao (pre-request) e salva `{{clienteId}}`, `{{clienteEmail}}` e `{{clienteSenha}}` para as requisicoes seguintes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Criar cliente (201)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/clientes",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "clientes"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cria **Usuario + Cliente** na mesma transacao (a FK id_usuario e NOT NULL). O role do usuario e sempre CLIENTE. Retorna **201** com header `Location`. \n\nO pre-request script gera um e-mail unico para o cadastro nao colidir em reexecucoes.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Maria Souza\",\n  \"telefone\": \"4291112222\",\n  \"usuario\": {\n    \"nome\": \"Maria Souza\",\n    \"email\": \"{{clienteEmail}}\",\n    \"senha\": \"{{clienteSenha}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 - Cliente criado",
              "originalRequest": {},
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": 3,\n  \"nome\": \"Maria Souza\",\n  \"telefone\": \"4291112222\",\n  \"ativo\": true,\n  \"criadoEm\": \"2026-08-19T23:22:52.215\",\n  \"usuario\": {\n    \"id\": 5,\n    \"nome\": \"Maria Souza\",\n    \"email\": \"maria.1787192571@teste.com\",\n    \"role\": \"CLIENTE\"\n  }\n}",
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json"
            }
          ],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// e-mail unico por execucao para evitar 409 de duplicidade",
                  "const email = 'maria.' + Date.now() + '@teste.com';",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('clienteEmail', email);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('clienteSenha', 'Cliente@123');",
                  "console.log('e-mail gerado:', email);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('header Location', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location')).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('corpo do cliente', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(b).to.have.property('id');",
                  "  pm.expect(b.ativo).to.be.true;",
                  "  pm.expect(b.usuario.role).to.eql('CLIENTE');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('clienteId', b.id);",
                  "console.log('clienteId salvo:', b.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
